  "visual": {
    "visualType": "textbox",
    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "What this suggests",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "1. Pre-campaign spend strongly predicts conversion on its own: without an SMS, 37% of the lowest-spend quartile convert versus 80% of the highest.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "2. The SMS lift shrinks as spend rises: +5.2 pp in the lowest quartile (CI +4.4 to +6.1), +3.5 and +2.9 in the middle two, +1.0 pp in the highest (CI +0.4 to +1.7). Every interval excludes 0, and the top and bottom quartiles do not overlap.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "3. Loyalty-points behaviour makes no real difference: about +3.2 pp for clients who never redeemed vs +3.4 pp for redeemers.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "4. Implication: per message, an SMS to a low spender produces about 5x the extra conversions of one to a top spender, most of whom convert anyway. If SMS volume is limited, send to lower-spend clients first.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "5. Age matters too, and stacks with spend - see the next page.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "drillFilterOtherVisuals": true
  }
}